"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌确认新一代旗舰模型Gemini 4已进入后训练阶段，有望提前发布</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌DeepMind负责人科拉伊·卡武克奥卢在AI Agenda Live峰会上确认，新一代旗舰模型Gemini 4已进入后训练（Post-training）初期阶段，有望远早于年底推出。该模型是继Gemini 3系列后的重大迭代，谷歌已跳过此前传闻的Gemini 3.5 Pro，将研发重心全面转向Gemini 4。目前，Gemini 4正处于防护机制开发与安全测试阶段，谷歌内部工程师已将其应用于Antigravity AI编程工具。卡武克奥卢表示，团队正加速推进后训练成果，旨在构建更具可靠性的智能体。此前谷歌曾通过发布Flash系列模型以提升学习速度，此次Gemini 4的推出标志着谷歌在旗舰模型领域的战略回归，旨在通过快速迭代保持技术前沿地位。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">智元第两万台远征A3 Ultra下线交付长隆，六千台半年填满，具身机器人第一次在主题乐园里常态上岗</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a4bff8a49fa33f8572fdc481f881ca00.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">智元第两万台远征A3 Ultra下线交付长隆，六千台半年填满，具身机器人第一次在主题乐园里常态上岗AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Sep 24, 202639智元把具身智能的产能刻度又往前推了一大格。9月24日，第20000台通用具身智能机器人远征A3Ultra在横琴长隆飞船乐园正式走下产线，并当场交到长隆集团手里。从今年3月跨过万台门槛到如今的两万台，这家公司只用了约6个月——产能爬坡的曲线，已经明显进入了加速段。同一天，由智元与长隆联手打造的全球首个大规模具身智能主题乐园在横琴长隆飞船乐园启幕，超过300台智元全系机器人开始在园区里常态化上岗，扎进游客互动、导览、演艺和科普研学等场景。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI在ChatGPT移动端推出语音智能体功能，支持语音指令执行任务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dd51c491a1a376446f6771e9bdc289bb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式在ChatGPT移动端上线基于语音的智能体功能，用户通过语音指令即可完成撰写文档、总结电子邮件及处理Slack消息等任务。该功能标志着ChatGPT的语音交互从单纯的问答模式升级为具备端到端任务执行能力的智能体。在功能权限方面，Pro和Plus订阅用户可利用该智能体创建文档、撰写邮件、制作PPT、创建网站及调用云端浏览器；Free和Go订阅用户则支持通过插件与已连接应用进行交互。此外，Plus订阅用户可在文本与语音模式间无缝切换，并支持跨设备（手机与电脑）协同处理工作。此次更新显著提升了移动端生产力场景下的交互效率，使语音输入直接转化为实际的办公产出。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta Connect发布会：Muse全面接入AI眼镜并推出多款智能硬件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0596dd329feb9582c2f0b2e7dba946d3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta在Connect大会上宣布个人智能体Muse全面接入智能眼镜，用户通过“Hey Muse”即可调用其健身指导、购物辅助及环境理解功能。Muse还将拥有独立邮箱，并支持Mac端App操作电脑，向全能智能体演进。硬件方面，Meta发布了无摄像头版Ray-Ban Meta Audio Glasses（349美元，续航12小时）及搭载1200万像素摄像头的Ray-Ban Meta Gen 3（449美元）。此外，Meta预告了2027年春季上市的轻量级VR眼镜（1299美元起）及类电子宠物形态的独立终端Muse Charm。针对听力受损人群，Meta将于年底推出听力增强功能。扎克伯格表示，Muse目前已登顶美区应用商店，未来将通过交易实现商业化。此次发布标志着Meta将AI、智能眼镜与VR硬件深度整合，旨在打造</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek年化收入突破10亿美元，拟募资500亿元冲刺上交所上市</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/58f6242907fbe1a7a1c35a2eb3f7b308.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">国内大模型公司DeepSeek年化收入已突破10亿美元，较数月前不足5亿美元的水平实现翻倍，增长主要源于产品定价上调及开发者与企业端采用率的提升。首席执行官梁文峰在投资者会议上披露了该财务数据，并确认公司正处于第二轮融资的关键阶段。DeepSeek计划在10月底前完成本轮融资，目标募资500亿元人民币，投后估值预计达到5000亿元人民币，并紧锣密鼓筹备上海证券交易所上市。在生成式AI商业化变现普遍承压的背景下，DeepSeek此次融资规模与估值预期均创下国内大模型初创企业一级市场新纪录。这一进展不仅印证了其大模型技术的商业落地能力，也为本土AI企业冲刺公开资本市场提供了重要风向标，显示出资本市场对头部AI模型厂商商业化路径的高度关注。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
